Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.10,0:00:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.38,0:00:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.72,0:00:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It somehow tastes even better in the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just love seeing the happy\Nfaces of my satisfied customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Numbing ice cream on a\Nhot day is non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I'll admit that frozen\Nfruit was pretty tasty too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never vendéd frozen fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.06,0:00:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard right, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, Kiko, you're selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, my pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go. Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So shiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dastardly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.03,0:00:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have expected no\Nless from my business rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.62,0:00:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sweet kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, I guess she's technically\Na full-fledged adult now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's even better at freezing\Nstuff now that she's officially a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.22,0:00:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she's freezing fresh fruit\Nand then selling it as a dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.08,0:00:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a rock-solid business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.40,0:01:01.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For sure, and those grep\Nthings were especially tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, and I'll have to give them a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that Temptress is\Ntrying to steal my partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for a food\Nwar, consider me enlisted!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal boss,\Nbut inside, I've still got a human soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of wonders,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.10,0:01:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I travel to and fro on the back\Nof my super strong partner, LAMAS!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.27,0:01:33.73,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(1773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name is Boxxo. Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you guys later
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.30,0:02:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be my favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.32,0:02:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to walk you through the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.34,0:02:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.88,0:02:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.76,0:02:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go to the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.16,0:02:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be the only one\Nthat I'm going to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to end it!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.09,0:02:45.51,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(357,1\fscx70\pos(476.8,52.4))\pos(409,54)}Each to Their Own Story
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fiend, I saw that smug grin\Ndisguised as an innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to wipe that look off your\Nface with the power of quality vending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.04,0:03:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must answer the call of food service.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.04,sign_Arial,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an1\move(120,275,297,335)\c&H7F4DBA&\3c&H44135C&\shad0\b0\bord4}You work so hard every day. Enjoy a cool treat!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(345,140,520,200)\c&H9B97CD&\3c&H1F0C4D&\shad0\b0\bord4\fs11\frz3.45\fax-0.08\fsp3}Chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(205,145,380,205)\c&H9B97CD&\3c&H1F0C4D&\shad0\b0\bord4\fs11\frz3.45\fax-0.08\fsp1.7}Strawberry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.04,0:03:14.04,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(80,155,255,215)\c&H9B97CD&\3c&H1F0C4D&\shad0\b0\bord4\fs11\frz3.33\fax-0.07}Vanilla
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even begged, I mean, asked\NLamas and Mishuel to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey everyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're selling extra creamy ice cream\Ntoday and there's plenty to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And today only, we're offering our\Nhigh-quality ice cream at low-quality prices.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.34,0:03:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a worthy rivalry\Nwhile it lasted, but too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.34,0:03:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mere mortal can measure up\Nto the power of my vending.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For some reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.80,0:03:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the next day, there was a huge crowd\Nchamping at the bit for cold fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got yummy frozen fruit over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should treat yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:04:00.51,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&HC4BCD6&\3c&H492A74&\shad0\move(80,65,0,65)\fs17\fscx85}Vanilla
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:04:00.96,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HC4BCD6&\3c&H492A74&\shad0\move(210,65,130,65)\fs17}Strawberry
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:04:00.96,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HC4BCD6&\3c&H492A74&\shad0\move(390,65,305,60,)\fs17\fsp1.1}Chocolate
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.96,0:04:00.96,sign_TimesNewRoman,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HC4BCD6&\3c&H492A74&\shad0\move(560,65,478,65)\fs17\fscx65}Matcha
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh reinforcements from\Nthe clear flow lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She even used food to\Nrecruit the gluttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it's time to vend\Nout the big guns, baby.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.97,0:04:06.97,sign_TrebuchetMS,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H514A45&\3c&HF7F7F7&\shad0\fs30\bord4}Shui
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's how you kill the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.12,0:04:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory shall be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our bitter sales battle waged on for four\Nwhole days and ended in a surprise attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We thanked our friends for\Ntheir help with a nice meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui and the Band of\NGluttons took full advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:33.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the priciest things on the menu,\Neating through our revenue and then some.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:38.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thus, the war of the frozen snacks\Nended in mutual defeat. The losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.86,0:04:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since our work was more\Nthan finished there,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we decided to mosey on back to\Nthe clear flow lake stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.05,0:04:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We really owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.22,0:04:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.96,0:04:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like something's weighing on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was starting to miss\Nthis rectangle of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.58,0:05:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo. The usual, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your drinks invigorate me to my very core.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been back a few days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.38,0:05:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fall will be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.62,0:05:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been here for almost a full year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time truly does fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.82,0:05:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last few days, I\Nhaven't seen Lamas or Hulemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must be busy or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a bit lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Boxxo! Lammis?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.60,0:05:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been crazy busy and\Ntotally neglecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a chance to make it right\Nwith some late-night bonding, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No man, flesh, or steel could refuse\NLamas when she's serving that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm whipped!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And loving it. Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.40,0:05:55.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get cozy in my tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.06,0:06:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheers to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wishing you a happy birthday, Boxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.70,0:06:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it my birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.82,0:06:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be fair, I don't\Nknow when you were born,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's creeping up on a year\Nsince we first crossed paths?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:19.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I thought it was as good a time\Nas any to celebrate your existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.36,0:06:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that's okay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.08,0:06:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so darn happy and surprised right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.94,0:06:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to react.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.08,0:06:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a good thing I can't ugly cry\Nor I might have short-circuited.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.54,0:06:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.94,0:06:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Kikuyu, we all want to say\Nhappy birthday to you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.36,0:06:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.24,0:06:43.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu's birthday wasn't too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a double birthday bash.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's twice as nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.46,0:06:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxxo, we owe you true without\Nyour assistance, the Origin stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be a pile of rubble we all wanted\Nto give you a proper thanks you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.92,0:07:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a real hero as far as we're concerned\Nthem's facts we owe you one i come
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bearing an official certificate of\Nrecognition from the Hunter Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.80,0:07:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been racking my brain\Nthinking of the best gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I came up with,\Nso I really hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I enhanced the elasticity\Nof the stabilizer ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it can handle unexpected\Ntransformations with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can change my look on\Nthe fly without worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.46,0:07:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm the last\None to gift you up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bet you're curious what I got ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.26,0:07:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That book you gave me had\Nall kinds of party pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where I came up with the\Ninspiration to make you a birthday cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, um, was it a good surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.28,0:08:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm easily the luckiest vending\Nmachine in the entire universe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a birthday cake in another world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If vending machines could cry, everyone\Nhere would be drowning about now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.82,0:08:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one's for Kikuyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.36,0:08:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The candles are waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and blow them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Boxxo and Kikuyu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.79,0:08:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to process this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not have turn into\Na vending machine and have
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lots of friends celebrate my\Nbirthday on my bingo card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.94,0:08:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The phone tonight is something special.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.66,0:08:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad the grandkids aren't\Nhere to enjoy it with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.48,0:08:54.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tempted to take some home\Nand dine on it tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.22,0:08:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this wine is delightfully smooth\Nwith just a slight hint of sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.44,0:09:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I deserve to have a super fun\Nand special drink tonight, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.34,0:09:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we secured this\Nfizzy-fruity one just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone talked up how much\Nthey were loving the feast,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I came to regret\Nbusting out the booze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.78,0:09:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.40,0:09:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got an awesome new\Ninvention all invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta check it out\Nsometime, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:32.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not taking me seriously,\NI can tell, so you got to thank it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How you doing, Boxo? Are you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:39.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope the answer is\Nhello there, because I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love feeling your cold\Nsteel against my warm skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.42,0:09:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm having an\Nabsolute blast, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're blasted, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.70,0:09:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.00,0:09:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than you could know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here and that's a huge load off.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:09:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was worried this whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That maybe you're just being nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm actually a big\Nstinkin' bother to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.64,0:10:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo buddy, wanna know something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.90,0:10:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had a wish, it would be to stay\Nright by your side forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.24,0:10:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.10,0:10:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pour my heart out and all\Nyou can say is hello there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.26,0:10:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, if I had a second wish,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be for you to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.24,0:10:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, she's too freakin'\Nadorable as a sloppy drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.36,0:10:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl's got my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, time to show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.44,0:10:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are cute when you dare drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.48,0:10:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.04,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(189,1)\an8\fs20\pos(479,130)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.60,0:10:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to speak with you about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have time tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something has clearly been\Nbugging her the last few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.02,0:10:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she ready to share?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:11:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the late hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is, we think the time has\Ncome for us to leave the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought that might be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.32,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate leaving it all behind when this\Nplace is still plagued by odd occurrences.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's awfully selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not selfish. You've helped a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.74,0:11:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no complaints here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.92,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blossoming into an adult\Nhas increased my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.24,0:11:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find that I can now hear the\Npiece of Field speaking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.64,0:11:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think returning Field to their\Nmain body could bring them back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must try, and thankfully I can rely on\NField's powers to open up the path for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.76,0:11:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's going all out to meet the\Nperson reincarnated as a Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do you, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're sure it's okay for me to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just occurred to me\Nthis might be the last
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time we talk you know\Nthe Nether Lord's power
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't enough not to get you two out of the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dungeon. Please tell me you\Nhave a plan. I'll open a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,temporary path by\Nchanneling my magic into a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,transfer circle Hula Me's\Ntheory but there's no
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.78,0:12:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guarantee and it's risky\Nshe's very much against
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the idea since it's quite\Ndangerous and may not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not gonna lie, Geolami brings points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.38,0:12:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.90,0:12:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to find Field, and I\Nwon't give up the search until I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.18,0:12:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's that important to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.00,0:12:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're legitimately willing to\Nrisk your life for this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.78,0:12:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for the children, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.26,0:12:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have enough magic power to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I must leave this place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.90,0:12:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your smiling faces...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:47.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It made me lose my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.42,0:12:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wipe those tears away. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.18,0:13:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are saving someone you care about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jenna!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Walk away knowing you did a swell job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.36,0:13:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a huge ensemble,\Nso we'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, you've done a lot for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.42,0:13:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had a heck of a time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.29,0:13:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, so am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.12,0:13:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll cherish these memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.82,0:13:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again, and I can't\Nwait until that day comes, Kikoyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.88,0:13:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:40.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next morning, I gave everyone\Nthe letters Kikuyu had left for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever that person is, I\Nhope she's able to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.37,0:13:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's even the slightest chance it\Nwill work, she has to give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or she'll regret it for\Nthe rest of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels kind of lonely without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.22,0:13:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.70,0:13:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, what's our plan of attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.68,0:14:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dog mountain stratum and the\Neverlasting stratum are all that remain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume we'll want to bolster\Nour forces before we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeesh, kiko yu's shoes are\Ngoing to be really hard to fill?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it's pivotal, and I'm afraid I\Ncan't spare anyone else for this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As expected, I'm thinking I'll invite\Nsomeone from the Menagerie of Fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.80,0:14:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fool I have in mind\Nis talented and has
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.52,0:14:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,certain abilities that our\Nlineup is sorely lacking,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,personality aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:29.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, can't argue on the talent front.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:31.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's def-legit, despite that temperament.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we be concerned\Nthat they both think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.04,0:14:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our next edition kind\Nof sucks as a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need all the help we can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.78,0:14:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea where we can find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I can't say for\Nsure, I have a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.70,0:14:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will require travel\Nto a new stratum. Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we're going to the Dog\NMountain Stratum to find a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A transfer circle should\Nmore than get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two days later, our group arrived\Nat the Dog Mountain Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.50,0:15:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name probably gave it away, but this\Nstratum has a giant dog-shaped rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.82,0:15:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decay rock aside, it's a marine\Nstratum with tiny islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we can spare some time for\Na little fishing while we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Carry Oil does love to cast a rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd love to start doling out some\NHawaiian shirts and get the party started.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we're not on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fresh from a transfer circle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, we're here from the\NClear Flow Lake Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go tell the\Ndirector, so don't move an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you folks really from another stratum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.50,0:15:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.06,0:15:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness the transfer\Ncircles are finally working.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.74,0:15:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can eat something other\Nthan seafood for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.82,0:15:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the monsters cause\Nany extra damage here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.60,0:15:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we were plagued with frequent\Nmonster attacks for a while there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then some incredible\Nhunters arrived and saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.22,0:15:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, that happened right before\Nthe transfer circles stopped functioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.90,0:15:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we made it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind me asking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did those hunters call themselves\Nthe Menagerie of Fools?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.42,0:16:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Small world, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.23,0:16:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's not good, but it's\Nprobably okay, right? It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, they contacted us earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.14,0:16:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt the director and the\Nothers were able to convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for visiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves at home!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like a kid, but I\Nguess it's the Stratum's director?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.84,0:16:24.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.78,0:16:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it most certainly has.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:29.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the director of the Dog Mountain\NStratum's Hunters Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I brought you a letter\Nfrom Director Bear if you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like to take a look is\Nthat a fact let me see oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:40.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This explains why the monsters\Ngot so aggressive that's good
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to know well good luck taking\Ncare of all that weirdness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can let me know\Nwhen the job's finished?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, please forgive his rudeness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.72,0:16:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's basically the babysitter\Nif I'm understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.14,0:16:59.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the situation You need us\Nto help you find someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's no problem whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.90,0:17:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you describe them?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.18,0:17:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We greatly appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you all the information we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.04,0:17:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While Heavy gave them the rundown, we\Ngot to enjoy some primo relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.16,0:17:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should we pass the time, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't exactly go swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next best thing for a beach\Nday is to enjoy some fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.40,0:17:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tss, eat food. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.52,0:17:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even my perceptive llamas\Ncouldn't decipher that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's tough not being able to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cast-tat-la-tin. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Si-i-foo-n.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cast-tat-la-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.76,0:17:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you want to go fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas is out of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.98,0:17:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure that was going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.08,0:17:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.18,0:17:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew I could figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.70,0:17:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is to\Nwork out the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.66,0:17:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.96,0:17:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really only know how\Nto do punchy fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.18,0:17:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a river that's technically not fishing\Ni love punchy fishing you can count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but instead of using our\Nfists or nailing them
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.10,0:18:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with rocks why don't we\Ntry the laid back method?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.24,0:18:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for a change sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.34,0:18:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great now we just need\Nthe right equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look no further ladies your friendly\Nneighborhood voxos got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't look like you\Nhave any rods for sale?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.78,0:18:15.69,sign_Verdana,sign,0,0,0,,{\shad0\bord4\pos(320,50)\fs25\fsp6\c&HF7E6F6&\3c&HFEFEF6&\t(1,188,\c&H6351AA&\3c&HC2BFBB&)}Fishing Goods
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.50,0:18:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can probably\Njust use a stick. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some bags have pictures of fishing\Nlines with floats and hooks attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But some only have symbols on them.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.46,0:18:31.58,sign_Verdana,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HF5F4F6&\3c&HB07F59&\shad0\bord4\fs25}Green Lugworm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.54,0:18:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are those baits?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.50,0:18:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go find some nice sticks for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.92,0:18:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost time for the moment of truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.38,0:18:39.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lot of girls scream\Nand cry and yell, Ew,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's grody, when they see\Nbait for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm weirdly fascinated to\Nsee how those two will react.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their cute expressions will be priceless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to record it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for science.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen things like that, but a\Nlittle different at the river before.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is kid stuff compared to some\Nof the monsters I've come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess that tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I expect them to\Nfreak out over a little
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worm when they fight ugly\Nmonsters on the regular?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make this a tad more interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.32,0:19:11.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever catches the biggest one\Nwill be named the fishing champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to hold back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.92,0:19:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got one! Up you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.28,0:19:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heck yeah, I got a shiwami!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you beat me! I-I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let Hulemy take the prize.\NBut second place is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.88,0:19:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll break!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grab the line, not the rod! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.24,0:19:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hooked a fish monster! Reel it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear those things are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what I caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she really caught a monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.56,0:19:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, did my hook snag on something?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The line might break if I pull any\Nharder, but this could be the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.66,0:20:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did you get a bite too, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:14.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.24,0:20:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is one enormous clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.14,0:20:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a monster\Nthat looks like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.62,0:20:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a mutation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.06,0:20:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think it's tasty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.68,0:20:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm curious, so let's cook it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.64,0:20:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This beast is looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.74,0:20:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Boxo, I've been\Nsearching high and low.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.36,0:20:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a nice fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.66,0:20:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that thing a clam?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big clam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It even took me shwell by surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.16,0:20:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, now I'm extra curious\Nto see what's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have some too, Mishuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Shui were here, she'd\Nprobably eat it all herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.32,0:21:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.92,0:21:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to need you to wipe\Nthat greedy look off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:14.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can get the\Nseaside barbecue started.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.60,0:21:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that... No way. What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.52,0:21:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're both looking at\Nthat clam like they know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, do you recognize that creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure do, I thought the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.20,0:21:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.92,0:21:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, so what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That clam looked rather familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so hot. Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how you should\Nbe treating poor pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A harmless shut-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.12,0:23:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.76,0:23:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.28,0:23:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.05,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs17.4\fscx89\pos(373.2,297.8)}The Clam and the Vending Machine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.

